WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.334 --> 00:00:02.467
-You guys, today's Friday,
that's usually

00:00:02.467 --> 00:00:03.501
when I catch up
on some personal stuff.

00:00:03.501 --> 00:00:05.367
I check my inbox,
I return some emails

00:00:05.367 --> 00:00:07.133
and of course I send out
thank you notes.

00:00:07.133 --> 00:00:08.300
And I was just wondering
if you guys...

00:00:08.300 --> 00:00:09.534
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:09.534 --> 00:00:10.534
...wouldn't mind,
I'd like to write out

00:00:10.534 --> 00:00:13.701
some thank you notes
right now.

00:00:13.701 --> 00:00:14.834
James, could I have some

00:00:14.834 --> 00:00:16.267
thank-you-note-writing music,
please?

00:00:16.267 --> 00:00:19.200
[ Gentle piano music playing ]

00:00:19.200 --> 00:00:20.501
-Wow.

00:00:20.501 --> 00:00:22.334
-James, could you do it in,
like, an organ style?

00:00:22.334 --> 00:00:24.634
Can you play like Finn?
-Da-da-da, da-da! Like that.

00:00:24.634 --> 00:00:26.367
-[ Vocalizing "Charge" tune ]
Finn. Finn. Finn. Finn. Finn.

00:00:26.367 --> 00:00:30.000
Finn. Finn. Finn. Finn. Finn.
Finn. Finn. Finn. Finn.

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:32.100
[ "Charge" tune playing ]

00:00:32.100 --> 00:00:33.100
[ Audience clapping on beat ]

00:00:33.100 --> 00:00:34.934
I'm not hearing it.
I can't hear it.

00:00:34.934 --> 00:00:36.501
[ Tempo increases ]

00:00:36.501 --> 00:00:40.501
♪♪

00:00:40.501 --> 00:00:41.667
[ Tune crescendos ]

00:00:41.667 --> 00:00:43.334
-All: Oh!

00:00:43.334 --> 00:00:44.334
[ Laughter ]

00:00:44.334 --> 00:00:45.334
[ Bell dings ]

00:00:45.334 --> 00:00:46.467
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:46.467 --> 00:00:50.000
-Yeah, that's the jam
right there.

00:00:50.000 --> 00:00:51.567
[ Vocalizing "Charge" tune ]
♪ Ba-da boom, bam-boom-bam ♪

00:00:51.567 --> 00:00:52.767
[ Funky "Charge" tune playing ]

00:00:52.767 --> 00:00:54.367
♪ Ba-da boom, bam-boom-bam ♪

00:00:54.367 --> 00:00:56.634
♪ Ba-da boom, bam-boom-bam ♪

00:00:56.634 --> 00:00:58.968
♪ Ba-da boom, bam-boom-bam ♪

00:00:58.968 --> 00:01:01.167
♪ Ba-da boom, bam-boom-bam ♪

00:01:01.167 --> 00:01:02.667
♪ Ba-da boom, bam-boom-bam ♪

00:01:02.667 --> 00:01:03.968
♪ Ba-da boom, bam-boom-bam ♪

00:01:03.968 --> 00:01:06.000
♪ Ba-da boom, bam-boom-bam ♪

00:01:07.000 --> 00:01:08.033
[ Music ends ]

00:01:08.033 --> 00:01:09.667
Oh, yeah.
-Oh. What's that?

00:01:09.667 --> 00:01:11.701
[ Audience laughs and applauds ]

00:01:11.701 --> 00:01:14.267
-You sat in front of her?
-Yeah, she was right there.

00:01:14.267 --> 00:01:16.167
-Wow.
-Those are good seats.

00:01:16.167 --> 00:01:17.534
-She was like moving her head
around, trying to see.

00:01:17.534 --> 00:01:19.200
-Cause you were wearing your
giant hat that you wear.

00:01:19.200 --> 00:01:21.067
-I was wearing my hairpiece.
Yeah, exactly.

00:01:21.067 --> 00:01:23.667
[ Laughter ]

00:01:23.667 --> 00:01:27.634
No, she's very lovely. I do --
I do love running into her.

00:01:27.634 --> 00:01:28.968
But it was --
It was a good crowd.

00:01:28.968 --> 00:01:30.100
It was super fun.

00:01:30.100 --> 00:01:32.334
Yeah, it was great.
But, you know, I --

00:01:32.334 --> 00:01:33.701
I just had a better view
than she did.

00:01:33.701 --> 00:01:34.934
-Yeah. Whatever.
Yeah, right.

00:01:34.934 --> 00:01:36.000
Not a big deal.

00:01:36.000 --> 00:01:37.334
-We saw the same thing.
-Yeah, sure.

00:01:37.334 --> 00:01:38.801
-Kind of.
-Yeah. But you saw better.

00:01:38.801 --> 00:01:41.534
Your your view was about
one foot better, yeah.

00:01:41.534 --> 00:01:42.567
-Less.
-Oh, sure.

00:01:42.567 --> 00:01:43.567
-Less than one foot.

00:01:43.567 --> 00:01:45.033
But just
let's just say better.

00:01:45.033 --> 00:01:46.334
-Alright.

00:01:46.334 --> 00:01:48.067
Like that. I could --
We could touch hands.

00:01:48.067 --> 00:01:49.300
Right? You could reach

00:01:49.300 --> 00:01:50.534
or you could reach back
and touch hands.

00:01:50.534 --> 00:01:51.767
-Yeah. I had to reach
back and strain myself.

00:01:51.767 --> 00:01:52.801
-Right.

00:01:52.801 --> 00:01:53.868
[ "Charge" playing
in background ]

00:01:53.868 --> 00:01:56.133
-And normally,
if we went together...

00:01:56.133 --> 00:01:57.367
-Right, she'd be sitting
next to you.

00:01:57.367 --> 00:01:58.601
-Yeah.
And we could hold hands here.

00:01:58.601 --> 00:02:00.367
-Right. But no.
-No.

00:02:00.367 --> 00:02:01.534
-Back seat.
-Right.

00:02:01.534 --> 00:02:02.801
I shouldn't even be
holding her hand at all.

00:02:02.801 --> 00:02:05.133
It wasn't a scary play.
It was...

00:02:05.133 --> 00:02:06.567
I had no business
holding her hand.

00:02:06.567 --> 00:02:08.667
-But you were anyway?
-I think it was her hand.

00:02:08.667 --> 00:02:10.133
I didn't look behind me.

00:02:10.133 --> 00:02:12.067
-You just put your hand out like
this, and somebody grabbed it?

00:02:12.067 --> 00:02:13.901
-Yeah, someone grabbed it.
I was nervous.

00:02:13.901 --> 00:02:15.534
-Yeah.
-I was nervous.

00:02:15.534 --> 00:02:16.934
I haven't seen a live play
a long time.

00:02:16.934 --> 00:02:19.067
-It's been five months.
-I was getting scared.

00:02:19.067 --> 00:02:20.467
I go, what's all
these lights and...

00:02:20.467 --> 00:02:21.734
-Especially because today --

00:02:21.734 --> 00:02:23.934
That was Friday the 13th
eve yesterday.

00:02:23.934 --> 00:02:26.167
-Yeah. By the time -- if I --
If the play went long,

00:02:26.167 --> 00:02:28.534
I would have been there
on Friday the 13th.

00:02:28.534 --> 00:02:31.334
-Scary.
-It ended around 8:39.

00:02:31.334 --> 00:02:34.501
-What?
8:39 exactly?

00:02:34.501 --> 00:02:35.567
-Yeah.

00:02:35.567 --> 00:02:37.567
-Wow. I bet it was a sudden end.
-8:39.

00:02:37.567 --> 00:02:39.801
-That's union rules.
-Oh, really?

00:02:39.801 --> 00:02:42.100
-Every Broadway show...
Together: has to end at 8:39.

00:02:42.100 --> 00:02:43.501
-Wow.
-Yeah.

00:02:43.501 --> 00:02:46.033
-On Fri-- On Thursday the 12th.
-On Thursday the 12th.

00:02:46.033 --> 00:02:48.767
-Yeah, it was good.

00:02:48.767 --> 00:02:50.000
You should go see it.
-I will.

00:02:50.000 --> 00:02:51.467
[ "Charge" tune crescendos ]

00:02:51.467 --> 00:02:54.100
[ Laughter ]

00:02:54.100 --> 00:02:55.534
[ Applause ]

00:02:55.534 --> 00:02:56.801
-Save it, save it.

00:02:56.801 --> 00:02:57.968
-[ Laughs ]

00:02:59.868 --> 00:03:02.601
Ready.
[ Clears throat ]

00:03:03.634 --> 00:03:05.667
[ Gentle piano music playing ]

00:03:05.667 --> 00:03:07.734
-Thank you, Autumn,

00:03:07.734 --> 00:03:09.834
for being fall's legal name.

00:03:09.834 --> 00:03:12.567
[ Applause ]

00:03:12.567 --> 00:03:14.167
Like a nickname.
-Autumn Joy Smith.

00:03:16.501 --> 00:03:17.667
[ Gentle piano music playing ]

00:03:17.667 --> 00:03:19.567
-Thank you, scarves

00:03:19.567 --> 00:03:20.901
for being the only clothes

00:03:20.901 --> 00:03:22.534
that you put on with attitude.

00:03:22.534 --> 00:03:24.534
[ Laughter ]

00:03:24.534 --> 00:03:26.133
[ Applause ]

00:03:26.133 --> 00:03:27.868
-Really?

00:03:27.868 --> 00:03:30.834
Why not?
-[ Chuckles ] Why not?

00:03:30.834 --> 00:03:32.400
[ Gentle piano music playing ]

00:03:32.400 --> 00:03:34.767
Thank you, step ladders,

00:03:34.767 --> 00:03:36.000
You're not my real ladder.

00:03:36.000 --> 00:03:38.734
But I can tell you
make my mom very happy.

00:03:38.734 --> 00:03:40.434
[ Laughter ]

00:03:40.434 --> 00:03:41.434
[ Rimshot ]

00:03:41.434 --> 00:03:44.100
[ Applause ]

00:03:44.100 --> 00:03:46.267
-[ As angry teen ]
Get away from me!

00:03:46.267 --> 00:03:47.734
You're not my real ladder!

00:03:47.734 --> 00:03:49.601
[ Laughter ]

00:03:49.601 --> 00:03:51.734
-[ Laughs ]

00:03:51.734 --> 00:03:53.501
[ As angry teen ]
This is my step ladder, Doug.

00:03:53.501 --> 00:03:54.968
[ Laughter ]

00:03:56.267 --> 00:03:57.734
[ Gentle piano music playing ]

00:03:57.734 --> 00:04:00.234
-[ Normal voice ] Thank you,
British TV shows

00:04:00.234 --> 00:04:02.133
for reminding me that just
because it's in English

00:04:02.133 --> 00:04:04.033
doesn't mean
I don't need subtitles.

00:04:04.033 --> 00:04:06.968
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:04:06.968 --> 00:04:08.801
-[ Indistinct ]

00:04:08.801 --> 00:04:12.133
[ Vocalizing
heavy British accent ]

00:04:12.133 --> 00:04:13.267
[ Laughter ]

00:04:13.267 --> 00:04:14.868
-[ Normal voice ]
Huh?

00:04:17.200 --> 00:04:18.534
[ Gentle piano music playing ]

00:04:18.534 --> 00:04:21.701
-Thank you,
being offered banana bread

00:04:21.701 --> 00:04:23.868
for being told all of our
bananas started to rot,

00:04:23.868 --> 00:04:25.634
so, well, here you go.

00:04:25.634 --> 00:04:27.000
[ Laughter ]

00:04:27.000 --> 00:04:28.467
Enjoy that.
-Live it up.

00:04:28.467 --> 00:04:29.767
-You don't got to tell me that.
-Yeah.

00:04:29.767 --> 00:04:30.801
-Yeah,
they were all going bad.

00:04:30.801 --> 00:04:33.033
So we made this for you.

00:04:33.033 --> 00:04:34.367
-They were moldy.
[ Chuckles ]

00:04:34.367 --> 00:04:35.567
[ Gentle piano music playing ]

00:04:35.567 --> 00:04:37.534
-Thank you,
VR headsets

00:04:37.534 --> 00:04:38.901
for being the coolest way

00:04:38.901 --> 00:04:41.167
to look like you're wearing
a jockstrap on your head.

00:04:41.167 --> 00:04:44.167
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:04:44.167 --> 00:04:45.934
-Hey! Oh!

00:04:48.000 --> 00:04:49.601
It smells ripe.

00:04:51.334 --> 00:04:52.868
[ Gentle piano music playing ]

00:04:52.868 --> 00:04:55.934
-Thank you,
plastic vampire teeth

00:04:55.934 --> 00:04:58.367
for being
Dracula's Invisalign.

00:04:58.367 --> 00:05:00.434
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:05:01.868 --> 00:05:03.634
Couldn't have done that joke
ten years ago.

00:05:03.634 --> 00:05:05.167
-Yeah.

00:05:06.167 --> 00:05:07.267
[ Gentle piano music playing ]

00:05:07.267 --> 00:05:08.634
-Thank you,

00:05:08.634 --> 00:05:11.634
kids who carve pumpkins
with super elaborate designs

00:05:11.634 --> 00:05:13.501
for making me think,
"That's really impressive.

00:05:13.501 --> 00:05:16.200
As well as.
"Do not anger this kid."

00:05:16.200 --> 00:05:19.200
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:05:21.367 --> 00:05:22.501
-Haha!

00:05:22.501 --> 00:05:23.501
Oh.

00:05:23.501 --> 00:05:24.868
[ Laughter ]

00:05:24.868 --> 00:05:26.167
[ Gentle piano music playing ]

00:05:26.167 --> 00:05:29.901
-Thank you, the moment
I finally get comfortable in bed

00:05:29.901 --> 00:05:31.734
for also being the moment
my bladder goes,

00:05:31.734 --> 00:05:33.167
"Guess what?"

00:05:33.167 --> 00:05:34.234
There you have it,
everybody.

00:05:34.234 --> 00:05:35.467
Those are my
"Thank You Notes."

